{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51561","headline":"宿金庭观（在嵊县东南七十二里） · 小白","name":"宿金庭观（在嵊县东南七十二里）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽客相留宿上方，金庭风月冷如霜。\n直饶人世三千岁，未抵仙家一夜长。\n（《嘉庆浙江通志》二三一《寺观》〖2〗）（〖1〗《增广圣宋高僧诗选後集》卷上收秀登《送小白上人归华顶》、《送贯微归天台》等诗，齐己《白莲集》中有寄赠贯微诗多首，因知小白亦应爲齐己同时人。\n〖参《全唐诗续拾》卷四一〗原列入时代未详僧，今移此。\n〖2〗见宋高似孙《剡录》卷八，参前张说条。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"小白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}